{"title": "Sunlight Sensitivity", "pageid": 4399, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sunlight_Sensitivity", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp, /w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp/300px-Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Sunlight_Sensitivity.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Sunlight Sensitivity</b> is a passive feature that imposes penalties when in sunlight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While in sunlight, this creature has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks that rely on sight. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aelis_Siryasius\" title=\"Aelis Siryasius\">Aelis Siryasius</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aminah\" title=\"Aminah\">Aminah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Anouk\" title=\"Anouk\">Anouk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arcagh\" title=\"Arcagh\">Arcagh</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Arden\" title=\"Arden\">Arden</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Argram\" title=\"Argram\">Argram</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Artimezt\" title=\"Artimezt\">Artimezt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Belub\" title=\"Belub\">Belub</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bonna\" title=\"Bonna\">Bonna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brathwen\" title=\"Brathwen\">Brathwen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brithvar\" title=\"Brithvar\">Brithvar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\">Bugthimble</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_(melee)\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)\">Cursed Kuo-Toa (melee)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_(ranged)\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa (ranged)\">Cursed Kuo-Toa (ranged)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief\">Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dalthar\" title=\"Dalthar\">Dalthar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danfora_of_the_Kingfish\" title=\"Danfora of the Kingfish\">Danfora of the Kingfish</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Danna\" title=\"Danna\">Danna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Drow\" title=\"Dead Drow\">Dead Drow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dhourn\" title=\"Dhourn\">Dhourn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dorikel\" title=\"Dorikel\">Dorikel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Drar\" title=\"Drar\">Drar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dunnol\" title=\"Dunnol\">Dunnol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elenna_Thrinn\" title=\"Elenna Thrinn\">Elenna Thrinn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Filro\" title=\"Filro\">Filro</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fonmara\" title=\"Fonmara\">Fonmara</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Furek\" title=\"Furek\">Furek</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Garmor\" title=\"Garmor\">Garmor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gergerann\" title=\"Gergerann\">Gergerann</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greymon\" title=\"Greymon\">Greymon</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grumm\" title=\"Grumm\">Grumm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grundril\" title=\"Grundril\">Grundril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Havkelaag\" title=\"Havkelaag\">Havkelaag</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Holvik\" title=\"Holvik\">Holvik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hurk\" title=\"Hurk\">Hurk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Incontinentia_Figgin\" title=\"Incontinentia Figgin\">Incontinentia Figgin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Izwae\" title=\"Izwae\">Izwae</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jerris\" title=\"Jerris\">Jerris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jhaam\" title=\"Jhaam\">Jhaam</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Avenger\" title=\"Justiciar Avenger\">Justiciar Avenger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Crusader\" title=\"Justiciar Crusader\">Justiciar Crusader</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Nightweaver\" title=\"Justiciar Nightweaver\">Justiciar Nightweaver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Justiciar_Soulhunter\" title=\"Justiciar Soulhunter\">Justiciar Soulhunter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Keris\" title=\"Keris\">Keris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kettel\" title=\"Kettel\">Kettel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kirgrath\" title=\"Kirgrath\">Kirgrath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kith\" title=\"Kith\">Kith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Inventor\" title=\"Kobold Inventor\">Kobold Inventor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Looter\" title=\"Kobold Looter\">Kobold Looter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Scout\" title=\"Kobold Scout\">Kobold Scout</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold_Thief\" title=\"Kobold Thief\">Kobold Thief</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\">Koll (kobold)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa_(creature)\" title=\"Kuo-toa (creature)\">Kuo-toa (creature)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kuo-toa_Hunter\" title=\"Kuo-toa Hunter\">Kuo-toa Hunter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kur\" title=\"Kur\">Kur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Limeleech\" title=\"Limeleech\">Limeleech</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lorlarrio\" title=\"Lorlarrio\">Lorlarrio</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lurgan\" title=\"Lurgan\">Lurgan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Magmar\" title=\"Magmar\">Magmar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Magron\" title=\"Magron\">Magron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mirthis\" title=\"Mirthis\">Mirthis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morghal\" title=\"Morghal\">Morghal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morgya\" title=\"Morgya\">Morgya</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moy\" title=\"Moy\">Moy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy_(wraith)\" title=\"Mummy (wraith)\">Mummy (wraith)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Murmath\" title=\"Murmath\">Murmath</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Narvass\" title=\"Narvass\">Narvass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ned%27Cirannis\" title=\"Ned'Cirannis\">Ned'Cirannis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nere\" title=\"Nere\">Nere</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Niram\" title=\"Niram\">Niram</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith\" title=\"Nym Orlith\">Nym Orlith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orgarth\" title=\"Orgarth\">Orgarth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phoskyx\" title=\"Phoskyx\">Phoskyx</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pistle\" title=\"Pistle\">Pistle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pooldripp\" title=\"Pooldripp\">Pooldripp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\">Popper</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Proselyte_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Proselyte of Mahkloompah\">Proselyte of Mahkloompah</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rylveth\" title=\"Rylveth\">Rylveth</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Duergar\" title=\"Shattered Duergar\">Shattered Duergar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skarjall\" title=\"Skarjall\">Skarjall</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Soreni\" title=\"Soreni\">Soreni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith\" title=\"Sorn Orlith\">Sorn Orlith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tecothy\" title=\"Tecothy\">Tecothy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thudd\" title=\"Thudd\">Thudd</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Torgga\" title=\"Torgga\">Torgga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Viss\" title=\"Viss\">Viss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\">Wraith</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Xargrim\" title=\"Xargrim\">Xargrim</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zira\" title=\"Zira\">Zira</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>Many <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Drider\" title=\"Drider\">Drider</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">Duergar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Kobold\" title=\"Kobold\">Kobold</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a> NPCs are sensitive to sunlight.\n</p>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has disadvantage on attack rolls and Perception checks while in sunlight.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 634/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3727/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2284/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5749/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643732/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.751     